cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived tables, please cite the manuscript."
title: "Chemical reachability limits mutagen-based TKI-resistance screens: analysis code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a study separating a mutagenesis
  screen's expected output into a supply term, from codon tables and each
  mutagen's six-class substitution spectrum, and a selection term, from
  chemistry-free deep mutational scans of KRAS G12C, ALK and MET. Every
  number the manuscript quotes is computed by a named function, recorded in
  a register, and checked against the manuscript by two audit scripts.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ronco
    given-names: Michele
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2160-2452"
    affiliation: "European Commission, Joint Research Centre (JRC), Ispra, Italy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/allkure/mutagen-reachability"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - preclinical resistance screens
  - mutational signatures
  - deep mutational scanning
  - base editing
  - prime editing
  - KRAS G12C
  - ALK
  - MET
  - chemistry bias
  - reproducibility
